  "category": "class",
  "text": "Your magic explodes. You know the following blood magic effect.\n\nBlood Magic—Explosion of Power Raw power explodes outward from you. Each creature within a 5-foot emanation takes 1d6 damage per rank of the spell you just cast (basic Reflex save). The type of damage depends on the tradition of your bloodline. If you cast arcane spells, you deal force damage. If you cast divine spells, you deal spirit damage. If you cast occult spells, you deal mental damage. If you cast primal spells, you deal fire damage.",
